      "op": "repair",
      "gaps": [
        {
          "storeId": "S4",
          "date": "2026-05-06"
        }
      ],
      "why": "S5 on 05-06 has two pharmacists on a one-required day (surplus 1 by formula) but both carry partial-day notes, so neither is a surplus donor: no solution.",
      "expect": {
        "status": "none",
        "message": "No solution within scope; search complete",
        "options": []
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "commit",
      "meta": {
        "kind": "manual"
      },
      "edits": [
        {
          "t": "move",
          "assignmentId": "S2|P1|2026-05-05",
          "toStoreId": "S1"
        }
      ],
      "why": "The DM may move a noted assignment by hand. Reading: Edit.move keeps the assignment (same id, same pharmacist/date) and the note is not carried over (types.ts: partialNote 'Not carried over'), so the moved assignment has no partialNote. The spec text itself is silent on move.",
      "expect": {
        "ok": true
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "state",
      "expect": {
        "state": {
          "assignments": {
            "A1": {
              "storeId": "S1",
              "pharmacistId": "P1",
              "date": "2026-05-05",
              "partialNote": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            },
            "A2": {
              "storeId": "S2",
              "partialNote": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            },
